					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE: REVERSE BYPASS\n\nIn this example we are using the Not node to reverse the boolean connected to the bypass inlet on the Color Offset node.\nInstead of asking the user: \"Do you want to disable this effect?\"  we ask \"Do you want to enable this effect?\"\nThis is really just a design preference."
					}
